{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:4e8a170108c6e141","name":"Marine Armor","source":{"id":"source:reference-4e8a170108c6e141","title":"Marine Armor","revision":20897,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T00:44:46Z","sha256":"d7a81d0cd6d2d39b4a1e028649878267c9119e2936c82d794f74e5f39ec2132a","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20897","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Marine%20Armor&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-4e8a170108c6e141","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Galaxy at War"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Galaxy_at_War"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["This ",{"tag":"a","children":["Light Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Light_Armor","referenceId":"reference:1b329ddc8a34adfe"}," is employed by ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Rebel Alliance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Rebel_Alliance","referenceId":"reference:52c543ff6d31425c"}," during the Galactic Civil War. It provides decent protection for front-line troops during ship-boarding actions and house-to-house fighting, and even in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Zero-Gravity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Zero-Gravity"},", in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vacuum"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vacuum","referenceId":"reference:f93faa368bc7aefa"},", or underwater. The armor's sealed life-support system allows the wearer to survive for up to 24 hours in the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vacuum"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vacuum","referenceId":"reference:f93faa368bc7aefa"}," of space or otherwise hostile environments. The soles of the armor's boots are magnetic, enabling the wearer to walk on metal surfaces, such as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship"}," hull, without drifting off into space. The magnetic soles reduce the wearer's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speed","referenceId":"reference:c372fee9b4566b85"}," by 2 squares.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A small propulsion system on the backpack allows the wearer to reroll any failed ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swim"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swim","referenceId":"reference:dd4fa375c70c4e42"}," checks, keeping the better of the two results; and even when rushed or threatened, the wearer can ",{"tag":"a","children":["Take 10"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Take_10"}," on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swim"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swim","referenceId":"reference:dd4fa375c70c4e42"}," checks and can maneuver without penalty in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Zero-Gravity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Zero-Gravity"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["If you are using the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Armor Upgrades"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Armor_Upgrades"}," option from ",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Scum and Villainy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scum_and_Villainy"}]},", Marine Armor has the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Aquatic Adaptation"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Aquatic_Adaptation","referenceId":"reference:f2799d513d319fc2"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vacuum Seals"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vacuum_Seals","referenceId":"reference:9bbb89865d7ea455"}," upgrades, plus one additional ",{"tag":"a","children":["Upgrade Slot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Upgrade_Slot"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Type:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Light Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Light_Armor","referenceId":"reference:1b329ddc8a34adfe"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 5,000\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Bonus to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},":"]}," +5\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Bonus to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"},":"]}," +2\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Maximum ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dexterity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dexterity"}," Bonus:"]}," +3\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 12 Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Restricted"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Restricted"},"\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
